# Raw CSVs are excluded by default. Aggregated/releasable CSVs may be force-added
# only after privacy review. Retained aggregate analysis outputs live under analysis/.
*.csv
!analysis/**/*.csv
!outputs/aggregated/**/*.csv
!reports/**/tables/*.csv

# Heavy private literature snapshot
